{"title":"Anvil/54","sourceTitle":"Anvil/54/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Observe que o sistema de níveis para bigornas começa com <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Copper\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Copper\">copper</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Copper\" title=\"Copper\"> </a></span>, ao contrário do sistema de níveis para <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Tools\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Tools\">tools</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Tools\" title=\"Tools\"> </a></span> e <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Weapons\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Weapons\">weapons</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Weapons\" title=\"Weapons\"> </a></span>, porque bigornas não podem ser criadas em <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Knapping\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Knapping\">Stone Age</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Knapping\" title=\"Knapping\"> </a></span>.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261111115641\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.004 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.004 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 85/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 530/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 158/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    1.178      1 -total\n 94.47%    1.113      4 Template:Ll\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wikinew-vs_:pcache:idhash:183576-0!canonical and timestamp 20261111115641 and revision id 397194. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","sections":[],"revid":397194,"sourceUrl":"https://wiki.vintagestory.at/index.php?title=Anvil%2F54%2Fpt-br","capturedAt":"2026-11-11T11:56:42.143Z"}